# Halo loop

Ask → harvest beads into **Keep** (not due) → when due they sit on **Home** → clear a cluster → thin **You're clear** + Keep pulse + mastery rings → daily habit later.

- **Keep (header beads) = not due.** One bead per banked fact, cap 30. Do not scatter these on Home.
- Sort Keep **gold → silver → bronze → new** (Cove toward the right). Within a rank, chronological (older left, newer right). New harvests still grow on the right of the new band.
- Rank is a metal ring on kind color. Do not gray bands. Do not resize beads.
- **Home = due.** Individual chips, 16 seats. Click one to play its **cluster**.
- Harvest lands in Keep, not on the Home field.
- Due drops the other way — bead leaves Keep and grows into its Home seat.
- Play-bank / due-drop flights are loop motion. Harvest flight and Home↔chat composer morph stay as they are. Do not retune harvest z-index 120.
- Paper/mixer polish is frozen unless Camron files a Replay of a ship-blocker.
- Lab `/preview` only until he says promote. Family `/ask` stays frozen.
- Persist Keep in `web/src/lib/keep-memory.ts`. Lab Mix → Loop walks the full loop (due, miss, clear, mastered, empty Home).
